---
import { parts } from "../data/v3-course";
---
<section class="course-overview" aria-labelledby="current-course-title">
  <h2 id="current-course-title">The course · Fifteen chapters</h2>
  <p>Begin with the changing engineering paradigm, then follow one fictional traffic intersection from uncertain intent to an integrated product and the engineering capabilities needed to sustain it.</p>
  <p class="course-status">Chapters 1–5 include short knowledge checks. In Chapter 5 you can change a vehicle’s arrival and see how the queue develops. Earlier lessons are available separately.</p>
  {parts.map(part => <section class="course-part" id={`part-${Number(part.chapters[0].number)}`}><h3>{part.title}</h3><ol start={Number(part.chapters[0].number)}>{part.chapters.map(chapter => <li><article><p class="chapter-number">Chapter {chapter.number}</p><h4><a href={chapter.url}>{chapter.title}</a></h4><p>{chapter.summary}</p><a class="manuscript-link" href={chapter.url}>Read chapter →</a></article></li>)}</ol></section>)}
</section>
<style>
.course-overview{margin:3rem 0;color:inherit}
.course-overview>p{max-width:75ch}
.course-status{border-left:3px solid currentColor;padding-left:1rem;font-size:.9rem;opacity:.85}
.course-part{margin:2rem 0}
.course-part ol{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,17rem),1fr));gap:1rem;padding:0}
.course-part li{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 35%,transparent);border-radius:.5rem;padding:1.2rem}
h4{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.4;margin:.5rem 0}
a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:.2em}
a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px}
.chapter-number,.manuscript-link{font-size:.8rem}
article>p{line-height:1.6}
</style>
